              "iconAlias": "window/minimize"
            },
            {
              "htmlAction": "maximize",
              "pixsoLayer": "最大化",
              "iconAlias": "window/maximize"
            },
            {
              "htmlAction": "close",
              "pixsoLayer": "关闭",
              "iconAlias": "window/close"
            }
          ],
          "sourceEvidence": "用户提供的 Titlebar actions DOM 片段；以语义 data-slot/data-action 为稳定身份，不把长 CSS nth-child 选择器作为映射主键。",
          "providedSelectorEvidence": "#runtime-directory > div:nth-child(4) > div > section > div > article > div > div.tui-runtime-titlebar-gallery > div > div:nth-child(1) > div > header:nth-child(2) > div",
          "notes": "这是 Titlebar 内部的窗口控制组映射，不是把整个 Titlebar 映射成 control button。"
